    "ingredients": [
      {
        "q": "1/2 cup",
        "n": "Instant coffee powder",
        "tag": "coffee",
        "img": "i-coffee"
      },
      {
        "q": "1/2 cup",
        "n": "Sugar",
        "tag": "sugar",
        "img": "i-sugar"
      },
      {
        "q": "1 cup, lukewarm",
        "n": "Water",
        "tag": "water",
        "img": "i-water"
      },
      {
        "q": "~1 cup per glass, cold",
        "n": "Milk",
        "tag": "milk",
        "img": "i-milk"
      }
    ],
    "steps": [
      {
        "t": "Put 1/2 cup instant coffee powder in a steel bowl.",
        "imgs": [
          "s1-1",
          "s1-2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Add 1/2 cup sugar.",
        "imgs": [
          "s2-1"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Pour in 1 cup lukewarm water.",
        "imgs": [
          "s3-1"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Whisk until it turns thick, glossy and frothy.",
        "imgs": [
          "s4-1",
          "s4-2",
          "s4-3"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Pour it into a steel container.",
        "imgs": [
          "s5-1",
          "s5-2",
          "s5-3"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Level the top. Keep it in the freezer for 2 hours to set.",
        "imgs": [
          "s6-1",
          "s6-2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Scoop the set dalgona into a glass.",
        "imgs": [
          "s7-1",
          "s7-2",
          "s7-3"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Pour cold milk over it.",
        "imgs": [
          "s8-1",
          "s8-2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Stir gently and serve cold.",
        "imgs": [
          "s9-1",
          "s9-2"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "tags": [
      "no-cook"
    ],
    "notes": "Voice (Hindi) says half cup coffee, half cup sugar, one cup lukewarm water, whisk until frothy, put in a container and let it set for 2 hours; it does not say where, I assumed the freezer. Milk amount and how many glasses it makes (I guessed 6, about 2 scoops each) are my guesses; no ice shown. A lot of coffee, so scale down if you like. Protein is from the milk only."
